# Example key.properties for signing production release APKs
# Place this file in apps/pos_app/android/key.properties (do NOT commit real keys to git)
#
# The intended path is to let scripts/provision_release_keystore.sh generate
# both the keystore and this file (custody and backup rules:
# docs/operations/release-signing-runbook.md).
#
# If you hand-write it, use ONE password value for BOTH entries below: Android
# keystores are PKCS12, which does not support a key password distinct from
# the store password — keytool silently ignores a second, different value, and
# the release build then fails at :app:packageRelease with
# "Get Key failed: Given final block not properly padded".
#
# storePassword=your_single_keystore_password
# keyPassword=your_single_keystore_password
# keyAlias=upload
# storeFile=/absolute/path/to/nhilos-upload.jks
